Nethack requires that the ansi.sys device driver be loaded into your system to
run. All you need to do is add DEVICE=ANSI.SYS to your CONFIG.SYS file. Then
reboot your system and play nethack.

This ansi.sys driver allows you to do some wierd things that aren't related to
nethack (like change screen colors easily, change the color of the prompt, etc)
